### Running the Application

{{#if (eq buildTool 'maven')}}
```bash
./mvnw spring-boot:run
```
{{else}}
```bash
./gradlew bootRun
```
{{/if}}

The application will start at http://localhost:8080

### Building the Application

{{#if (eq buildTool 'maven')}}
```bash
./mvnw clean package
```
{{else}}
```bash
./gradlew build
```
{{/if}}

